Iron Skin is a monk discipline that toughens the body through rigorous
conditioning. Through years of training, the monk's skin becomes resistant
to cuts, abrasions, and other surface injuries.

This passive skill provides significant immunity to skin conditions and
substantially reduces the chance of bleeding when wounded. At high levels
of mastery, wounds that would cause others to bleed profusely may barely
break the monk's hardened skin.

Iron Skin is part of the Iron Body discipline, which includes techniques
for hardening various parts of the monk's body through meditation and
physical conditioning.

Class: Monk
Discipline: Iron Body

